src/wirk_cli/hooks.py ports the table of agent harnesses and their hook files from
kata (https://github.com/kenn-io/kata, commit e35bdc890764e7e2b5e37f70d8381018307ea9df), used under the
MIT License below, and the hook file locations of kit's agenthook package
(https://github.com/kenn-io/kit, v0.45.0, agenthook/claude.go and codex.go),
used under the Apache License, Version 2.0, Copyright 2026 Kenn Software LLC.

Modified: rewritten in Python for wirk login; cut to the harnesses whose hooks file uses
the Claude Code JSON shape and whose sessions wirk signs in as themselves (Claude Code,
Codex, Grok); the session-start hook prints WIRK's method card and status, and the
session-end hook posts one WIRK message about held work instead of kata's attention
metadata.

